e: false` and `remote_supabase_write: false`.\n- No frontend, Paper Workspace, UI wording, visual UX, external VLM, or Supabase mutation/upload/probe changes.\n\n## Verification\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/learning/__tests__/full-beta-3530-attempt-event-contract.test.js`\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true ./node_modules/.bin/eslint scripts/learning/lib/full-beta-3530-attempt-event-contract.js scripts/learning/__tests__/full-beta-3530-attempt-event-contract.test.js`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (exit 0; branch-safety warning only)","created_at":"2026-07-03T04:53:58Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T05:55:50Z","closed_at":"2026-07-03T05:55:50Z","merged_at":"2026-07-03T05:55:50Z","merge_commit_sha":"ac870c9321e804e5c7b2d2a64e98d8a0fc96910c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1218/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1218/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1218/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/a464638900c78c47c94d1f14616368b1cb194e0c","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1191","ref":"feat/issue-1191","sha":"a464638900c78c47c94d1f14616368b1cb194e0c","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_u